    "title": "4-month old dislikes when diaper is strapped on - sign of a problem?",
    "body": "<p>Recently, my 4-month old has developed a distaste for strapping in on a diaper - he's perfectly fine when one is being taken off, and during the entire process of cleaning and preparing him, but gets exceptionally fussy when it's time to attach the velcro straps to the diaper.</p>\n<p>Is there anything specific that might cause discomfort during the strapping-on part of diaper changing?</p>\n"
  },
  "answers": [
    {
      "owner": {
        "account_id": 2516845,
        "reputation": 2862,
        "user_id": 9825,
        "user_type": "registered",
        "profile_image": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b01bd8a23b6e8bd0c02debddbea921ba?s=256&d=identicon&r=PG",
        "display_name": "Zibbobz",
        "link": "https://parenting.stackexchange.com/users/9825/zibbobz"
      },
      "is_accepted": false,
      "score": 4,
      "last_activity_date": 1641910202,
      "creation_date": 1641910202,
      "answer_id": 42297,
      "question_id": 42293,
      "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "body": "<p>So I did figure something out - it seems like he gets bored when I'm changing him, and begins to fuss as I'm strapping him in.</p>\n<p>Handing him a soft, safe toy to play with seems to help - so I've taken to doing that with each changing.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "owner": {
        "account_id": 1946899,
        "reputation": 3943,
        "user_id": 14484,
        "user_type": "registered",
        "profile_image": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/d1606e78c0f8e9cf00a42043d5c3cf97?s=256&d=identicon&r=PG&f=y&so-version=2",
        "display_name": "user1751825",
        "link": "https://parenting.stackexchange.com/users/14484/user1751825"
      },
      "is_accepted": false,
      "score": 1,
      "last_activity_date": 1686055678,
      "last_edit_date": 1686055678,
      "creation_date": 1641975565,
      "answer_id": 42301,
      "question_id": 42293,
      "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "body": "<p>I'm a little confused about the &quot;strapping it onto his body&quot;. The diaper tabs don't attach to the child, they attach to the front of the diaper.</p>\n<p>You may need to check that you're putting it on correctly. The velcro/sticky tabs should not be touching his skin at all, and if they are, I can understand how this would likely be very uncomfortable.</p>\n<p>Also check that you're not making it too tight. It just needs to be tight enough that it doesn't fall off.</p>\n<p>You could also perhaps try a different brand. We tried various brands until we found one that worked well.</p>\n"
    }
  ],
